{
  // Strings rendered by s2sdk itself. Keys are prefixed with "S2SDK." because the
  // translations plugin merges every loaded file into one flat key namespace.
  //
  // Language codes are the ISO codes that s2sdk maps `cl_language` onto; a client whose
  // language has no entry falls back to "ServerLanguage" from settings.jsonc, then to the
  // English text compiled into src/core/localization.cpp.
  //
  // "{0}", "{1}" are positional placeholders and must be kept as-is, though they may be
  // reordered to suit the language. Format specs ("{0:>8}") are not supported.

